<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Constantine XI Palaiologos</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 1453</span> · <a href="/centuries/15th-century">15th century</a> · Also known as Constantine XI</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Constantine XI Palaiologos was the last emperor of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a>. He died in 1453 defending <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/constantinople">Constantinople</a> against the Ottoman army of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mehmed-ii">Mehmed II</a>. His death and the fall of the city ended the Byzantine state.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/constantine-xi-palaiologos.jpg" alt="Constantine XI Palaiologos" width="320" height="387" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: ILoveHirasawaYui · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Konstantinos_XI_Palaiologos_fresco_(less_edited).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
